","instruction":"I'm refactoring the Shadow.hlsl file to merge duplicate sampling functions into unified core functions. Key changes: 1) Fix PCSS sampler bug - PCSS needs TWO samplers (sampler_linear_clamp for blocker search, sampler_linear_clamp_compare for PCF). Remove the SHADOW_SAMPLER macro hack and use explicit sampler names instead. 2) Replace 4 SampleXxxShadowAtlas functions with 2 core functions (SampleShadowAtlas for no-bounds, SampleShadowAtlasClamped for with-bounds). 3) Replace 4 FilterXxxShadowPoisson with 2 core functions. 4) Replace 4 BlockerSearch_Xxx with 2 core functions. 5) Replace 4 FilterXxxShadowPCSS with 2 core functions. 6) Keep the 4+2 entry-point Filter functions as thin wrappers. All comments in English per memory 4tfux7po.","apply_mode":"apply_only"}},"timestamp":1773846276,"type":"TOOL_CALL_ARGS"}

